WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.760
To protect your home, you all 
need to work together!

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.390
I lost...

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.700
One more time! Let's play once more!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.000
You'll pay.

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.320
I'm going to make you pay...

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.150
Academia!

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.330
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:02.110
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.480
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:46.010
Heartland City in Despair

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.090
So you still can't get through to Yuzu?

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.040
No.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.580
Kurosaki isn't back from searching 
for the Resistance, either.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.200
I found it!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.020
Water! Water!

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.100
Hey!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.390
Sawatari...

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.770
Feels so good!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.970
Water! Water!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.420
Water, water... Water—

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.570
Get a grip!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.640
Water?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.770
I told you—

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.460
No, over there!

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.960
Hey!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.030
Hey!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.540
Wait!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.420
Hey, it's okay if we take one can, right?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.040
I thought it was strange that you 
volunteered to carry things.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.430
So that's what you were after!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.050
No, Sawatari.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:07.360
Can't you tell how valuable those 
are by the way things look?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.760
We need to return them all.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.640
B-But...

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.450
Stop it!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:21.380
P-Please... Spare me!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.040
Someone's there!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.580
Academia!

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:41.690
This is awful.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.760
No! Don't take it!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.170
No... Don't!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.770
Q-Quiet down.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.820
Please be quiet!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.000
Stay back!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.810
Please spare my children!

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.800
You have it all wrong.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.780
We didn't come here to hurt you.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.360
We're returning these.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:09.150
Here, take them.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.760
Please! Please!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.580
Please.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:21.050
As you can see, we really aren't 
going to harm you. Calm down.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.030
Don't be afraid. They belong to you, right?

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.170
Here.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.440
I can't take it!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.410
Wait!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.710
Come back!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.250
Don't hurt him!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.220
Here.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:58.840
Stop looking so greedy and keep watch!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.980
If you aren't from Academia, 
what are you doing here?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.300
We're looking for a friend.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.060
Her name is Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:13.040
She's about our age, and she wears 
a bracelet on her right arm.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.450
Have you seen anyone by that description?

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:19.300
No... No young people are here anymore.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.250
They were all turned into cards.

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:25.020
But what about the Resistance?

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:29.630
Heartland has the Resistance 
to fight Academia, doesn't it?

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.020
The Resistance?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.720
Unite the dimensions?

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.520
This world was split into four,

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:57.560
based on summoning method— 
Fusion, Xyz, Synchro, and Standard.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.910
Our noble mission is to unite them.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.330
We will create an ideal world!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.680
That's ridiculous!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.600
I'll turn you into a card!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.410
Stop.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.400
Don't stop me, Ute!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.660
Don't that won't change anything.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.740
Ute!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:17.460
There must be other ways to 
restore peace to this world.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:34.070
It's all destroyed?

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.160
The Resistance is gone...

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:43.310
They were all beaten, every single one.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.980
Even my husband,

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.730
my children's father.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.520
Right before my eyes...

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:55.390
It's all because of duels!

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.780
Hey, that's...

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:01.360
Cut it out, Sawatari!

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:05.420
I can't stop myself! Let me eat something!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.830
We have to stand guard!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.200
I'm at my limit... Just one bite.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.410
No, just the juice at the bottom of the can!

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:13.390
P-Please!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.510
What a sad sight.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.390
This is when an immovable spirit—

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.070
Want some, mister?

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.040
A warrior must maintain the highest—

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:35.860
Let's eat together.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:36.940
Can we?

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:37.670
Yeah!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.200
Found five of them.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.690
I'll finish them off at once.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.370
Stop it!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:53.410
Oh? You're duelists?

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:57.610
We've been fighting total weaklings 
lately. It's been so boring...

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:00.520
For the first time, we can really let loose.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.890
Duels aren't tools of war!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.430
A true duel brings smiles to everyone!

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.630
Duel!

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.100
Field Spell Crossover.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.780
It's dangerous. Don't go out there.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:25.740
I'll take the first turn!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.490
I've never seen duel disks like those.

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:30.480
They aren't with the Resistance?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.720
We're with the Lancers!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.320
Lancers?

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.580
Yeah.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.750
The word "Lancers" refers to soldiers

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:42.430
who rode a horse, spear in hand, into enemy lines.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.390
I make this promise to the world today.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.130
I will annihilate our enemy.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:58.480
We, of the Lancers, are here 
to stop Academia.

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:01.380
To stop the interdimensional war!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.340
War?

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:04.780
What are you talking about?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.990
Aren't you invading the Xyz Dimension?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:14.090
We're just following the Professor's orders
 and seeing our mission through!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.670
To revive the world, for the Aquaria Project.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.100
To create an ideal world!

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:27.270
The Aquaria Project?

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.310
What is that?

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.050
Destroying a town, turning people into cards...

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.610
What kind of ideal world is that?!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:39.320
Duels that take things away from people 
and make them sad are wrong!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.920
Duels bring people happiness.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.090
They make them smile!

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:49.120
Yes... That's what we've been fighting for.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:53.460
Even in the Synchro Dimension, in City.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:57.800
Two types of people live here, Tops and Commons.

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:03.140
Put simply, Tops are winners, 
and we Commons are losers.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:07.120
Winners get everything, leading lives of luxury.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:10.580
Losers struggle just to get enough 
food to survive every day.

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:17.420
And if you resist in any way, security will 
capture and throw you in prison.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.960
Security always sided with the Tops,

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.830
making the Commons suffer.

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:31.670
Roget, the head of security, 
was plotting to take over City.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:38.040
And he submitted an evil duelist to City's 
most popular duel tournament,

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.180
the Friendship Cup.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:45.480
To create a new duel champion, 
and to assert his power.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:52.860
Riding duels are fought on D-wheels, 
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:53.990
And through those duels,

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.730
Roget did everything he could to crush us.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.080
I wanted to win the tournament,

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.440
to show those people how great duels can be!

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:12.460
And I wanted to stop the fighting 
between Tops and Commons.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:17.650
Also, for the sake of the allies I made 
in those battles, Shinji and Crow!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:22.150
Put another way, Yuzu is a 
sacrifice to that world...

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:27.130
That's the reason I'm fighting to 
change this rotten society!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:35.340
To accomplish that, we, the oppressed 
Commons, must unite our energy

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:38.330
and overturn the Tops' control of this world!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:41.810
This time, I will get the Commons to rise up.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:47.510
But Roget wanted the Tops and 
Commons to remain at odds.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.950
I thought they'd never get 
a truly peaceful society that way.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.520
But...

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:59.670
Before the Friendship Cup ended, 
the Commons rioted!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.470
Revolution! Revolution!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.950
Revolution!

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.370
Mama! I'm scared!

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.650
Hey, kid... It's okay.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:17.440
Even if our revolution succeeds,

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:22.960
if Tops kids lose their homes and end up hating 
Commons, resentment will persist.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:26.650
This won't change anything!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.960
Attention, all residents of City.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.690
I, director of the Public Order Bureau,

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.390
Jean-Michel Roget,

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:40.100
in response to the rioting 
by Commons in all areas,

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:46.070
and as an answer to the many Tops' 
requests to restore order in City,

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.270
hereby declare martial law.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:51.980
Then, Yuzu, whom he had captured...

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.480
This is no time to be fighting amongst ourselves.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:59.760
Tops and Commons need to stop 
fighting and unite right now!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:02.950
Academia is after the Synchro Dimension, too!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.660
Yuya, if you can hear me, do as I say.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.720
Stop the fighting.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:12.780
Make everyone smile with the entertainment 
duels we learned at You Show—

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.630
Stop it!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.540
Yuzu!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:20.000
Then the King of Duelists, Jack Atlas, 
sent me a message, too.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.880
He told me to fight in the Friendship 
Cup semifinals with him.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:28.150
He told me to show him the kind of 
duel I believed in, with all my heart.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.480
If you're trying to accomplish something,

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.750
do not falter!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:38.520
The words from those two gave me strength.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.930
In the finals, I wanted to prove that...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.630
That duels aren't tools of war.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.990
They exist to make people smile!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:02.460
I... I told you everything I know!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.610
So please spare me!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.820
Reiji Akaba...

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:12.950
That's the name of the Professor's son?

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:17.090
Y-Yes! That's all I know!

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.600
Then, if I catch him...

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.420
Please! I've told you everything I know!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.300
Spare me.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:35.210
I have no doubt that our 
enemy still has Ruri.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.100
But I promise to rescue her.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.850
In order to do that,

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.900
I need you!

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.590
I see.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:48.460
You need me for a hostage exchange.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.060
Exactly.

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:56.000
I kept attacking LDS and sent you 
cards with souls trapped inside

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.200
so that I could draw you out.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:03.940
Even Leo Akaba won't say 
no in exchange for his son!

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:06.180
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:07.660
What?

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:12.460
I don't think he cares about me.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.140
What do you mean?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.650
Well, whatever.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.540
If you want to battle, I'm willing to accept.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.890
But I have one condition.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:28.130
I thought that trusting him would 
be a shortcut to saving Ruri.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:36.780
At first, the Resistance's Kurosaki 
was against us,

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.140
but he reconsidered and joined the Lancers!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.980
And not only Kurosaki!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.020
I've... learned the truth.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.740
I know what Academia is really doing.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.290
I don't want to become the servant of a devil!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:17:00.340
That's why I really want to save Yuzu, at least!

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:04.410
I don't want Yuzu in the prison 
that is Academia.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.650
They were both from Academia.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.770
Through our duels, we came 
to understand each other.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:16.580
And if everyone works together, we can 
bring peace back to the world!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:20.180
It was my duel with Jack that taught me that!

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.250
I see! Is that it?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:27.160
Are these your words, Yuya Sakaki?

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:33.030
Each voice is small. But together, 
they can create great resonance.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:39.150
Has your hope, the feelings you believe 
in, reached all of City, then?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.290
Amazing... This is amazing!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.640
It's a huge rally throughout all of City.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.380
I've never seen anything like it!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.200
Bring it, Yuya!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.190
See your duel through to the end.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.590
I'll oppose it with everything I have!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:57.680
Swing...

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.520
...my soul's pendulum.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:01.040
Trace a shining arc...

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.490
...in the sky!

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:07.420
Pendulum Summon!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.700
This is the finish!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.360
Wow.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:43.960
I've never seen a duel like that before.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:48.170
This is a real duel...

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:59.550
My duel with Jack filled City with smiles.

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:03.430
But...

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.030
But there is no need to run now.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:11.070
I am dead, either way.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:13.000
So I shall take you...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:17.470
no, the whole city with me.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:21.740
I shall plunge everything into the 
gap between dimensions!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.260
Fall! Fall!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.470
Fall, all of you!

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.420
Master Layra!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.060
Layra!

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.030
Brother!

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.200
Roget!

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.270
What?

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.910
What is that?

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.720
It's such a bright light.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.880
It's enveloping...

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.950
The Public Order Bureau...

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:09.380
It's disappearing.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.960
The symbol of Tops' control...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.430
Security's headquarters...

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.400
Yes! Disappear, disappear!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.230
If things won't go the way I want,

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:26.700
this world... all of you... can disappear!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.990
Disappear, all of you!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.290
Is everyone okay?

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.360
Let's go together, Yuzu.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.180
What is this?

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:03.210
What? What's going on?

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.320
I don't know.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:07.260
I don't know. But if the dimensional 
transport is still...

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.010
Yuzu!

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:11.480
Yuya!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:13.220
Yuzu!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.650
All right...

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.880
Now I'll treat you to some of the 
terror you've been dishing out.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:29.500
Stop!

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.120
Hey, how do you use this thing?

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.700
Don't do that!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:35.800
Why not?

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:38.110
If we leave them, they'll come after us again.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.750
Duels don't exist to bring terror!

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:41.910
You know that, right?

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:42.950
Damn!

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:46.220
See? There they go.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:50.650
What was that?

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.660
There are still others?

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:07.840
Are you ready to make your confession?

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:51.870
Wait! You're with the Resistance, right?

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:53.340
We're on your side!

00:23:53.340 --> 00:23:55.900
This duel will tell me if you're friend or foe.

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:57.250
Now, get ready!

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.680
Sounds interesting. Let's do it, then...

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:03.000
Don't rise to his provocation.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:07.160
This is no time for Academia's fellow 
enemies to be fighting each other!

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:09.990
You're invaders from another dimension.

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:11.850
You're enemies of the Xyz Dimension!

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:15.480
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Eyes of Galaxy

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:17.450
The fun is only getting started!
